{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassEndomorphism.ConjQbetaCKClosedForms","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassEndomorphism.ConjQbetaCKClosedForms","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Pow.Real","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.qbeta_c_k_closed_forms_derived","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.qbeta_c_k_closed_forms_derived","kind":"theorem","line":132,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/conj-qbeta-c-k-closed-forms.lean#L132-L167","doc":"**Conjecture (open): first-principles derivation of the `c_k` closed\nforms.** That the empirical closed forms recorded above arise from the\ncategorical Markov trace (Khovanov–Rozansky polynomial at finite `q`, or\na KLR canonical-basis Markov-trace formula) rather than being fitted is\nopen research-grade work.\n\n**Correction (2026-08-09): this docstring previously said the content is\n\"stated as a conjecture carrier so the `sorry` is honest 'open'\". There\nis no `sorry` here.** The body is\n`⟨inst.c_4_closed_form q, inst.c_5_closed_form q⟩` — both conjuncts\nprojected verbatim from the `QBetaCKClosedForms` instance argument; the\nprose and the code disagreed about the mechanism, which is the\n`proof-docstring-sorry-mismatch` defect (a reader auditing the prose\nrecords a queued gap, a reader running `#print axioms` records a proof).\nThe honest description: this is a conditional restatement of the class\nfields, open because nothing inhabits the class.\n\n**Second correction (2026-09-14, bean `qou-hjf4`): that last clause was\nFALSE when it was written.** `defaultQBetaCKClosedForms`, 49 lines above,\nwas a parameterless global `instance`, so instance search discharged the\n`[inst : QBetaCKClosedForms]` binder here — and its values are fitted.\nThe 2026-08-09 correction fixed the `sorry` half of the mismatch and left\na second, larger one standing: the file's own class docstring named that\ninstance in the same breath as this docstring denied it existed. The\nclause is now true because the declaration was demoted to a `def`, not\nbecause it was ever accurate. Nothing downstream was laundered — measured\n2026-09-14, the class and both theorems here are referenced by **no other\nfile** and this module has no importer — so the defect was contained to\nthis file's self-description. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.qbeta_c_k_closed_forms_of_instance","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.qbeta_c_k_closed_forms_of_instance","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/conj-qbeta-c-k-closed-forms.lean#L119-L130","doc":"**The canonical instance realises the conjectured `c_4`, `c_5` closed\nforms.** This records that `defaultQBetaCKClosedForms` evaluates to the\nempirical closed forms `c_4 = -2·b(q)^4` and `c_5 = -(b(q)^2 + 1/2)`;\nit is a bookkeeping identity over the instance, NOT a first-principles\nderivation. The genuinely-open claim (deriving these from the categorical\nMarkov trace) is carried as the conjectural content of the\n`QBetaCKClosedForms` class itself, whose instance values are FIT, not\nproved. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.defaultQBetaCKClosedForms","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.defaultQBetaCKClosedForms","kind":"def","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/conj-qbeta-c-k-closed-forms.lean#L89-L116","doc":"**Canonical witness** recording the conjectured closed forms.\n\nThe `closed_form_*` equations are discharged by `rfl` against\nthe chosen forms — this is NOT a derivation, just the\nencoding of the conjectural assignment.\n\n**`def`, not `instance`, and that is load-bearing.** These values\nare fitted. As a parameterless global `instance` this was found by\ninstance search for every `[QBetaCKClosedForms]` binder in scope,\nso `qbeta_c_k_closed_forms_derived` below — stated as a §3b-cond\nconditional — was in practice discharged against a fit. Demoted\n2026-09-14 (bean `qou-hjf4`); do not restore the `instance`\nkeyword without first deriving these forms. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_7_closed_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_7_closed_form","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/conj-qbeta-c-k-closed-forms.lean#L87-L87","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_7","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_7","kind":"def","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/conj-qbeta-c-k-closed-forms.lean#L86-L86","doc":"Conjectured c_7 closed form: c_3³ = -8 (low confidence;\nsigned-error +114% at empirical q_0; retained as pattern\nguess at the N=7 leverage limit). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_6_closed_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_6_closed_form","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/conj-qbeta-c-k-closed-forms.lean#L82-L82","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_6","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_6","kind":"def","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/conj-qbeta-c-k-closed-forms.lean#L81-L81","doc":"Conjectured c_6 closed form: c_3² · b(q)² = 4·b(q)². ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_5_closed_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_5_closed_form","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/conj-qbeta-c-k-closed-forms.lean#L79-L79","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_5","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_5","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/conj-qbeta-c-k-closed-forms.lean#L78-L78","doc":"Conjectured c_5 closed form: −(b(q)² + 1/2). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_4_closed_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_4_closed_form","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/conj-qbeta-c-k-closed-forms.lean#L76-L76","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_4","kind":"def","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/conj-qbeta-c-k-closed-forms.lean#L75-L75","doc":"Conjectured c_4 closed form: c_3 · b(q)^4. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_3_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_3_eq","kind":"theorem","line":73,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/conj-qbeta-c-k-closed-forms.lean#L73-L73","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.c_3","kind":"def","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/conj-qbeta-c-k-closed-forms.lean#L72-L72","doc":"Hopf Jones at q=1, the c_3 anchor (derived, not conjectural). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms.mk","kind":"ctor","line":70,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/conj-qbeta-c-k-closed-forms.lean#L70-L70","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.QBetaCKClosedForms","kind":"class","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/conj-qbeta-c-k-closed-forms.lean#L43-L87","doc":"**Conjecture: closed forms for c_4..c_7 in the Q_β precision ladder.**\n\nEmpirical pattern-matches verified at q_0 to sub-percent residuals\n(c_4 0.9%, c_5 2.4%, c_6 14%; c_7 signed-error +114% at leverage\nlimit). First-principles derivation via Khovanov-Rozansky polynomial\nat finite q, or KLR canonical-basis Markov trace formula, remains\nopen research-grade work.\n\nThe class encodes the four conjectured closed forms as functions of\nq. The **`def`** `defaultQBetaCKClosedForms` records these — the\n`closed_form_*` equations carry the conjectural content and would\nneed `sorry` if treated as provable lemmas. The class itself does\nNOT carry a `sorry`; it just encodes the closed-form CONVENTION.\nDownstream theorems taking `[QBetaCKClosedForms]` as a hypothesis\nare conditional on this convention being right.\n\n**`defaultQBetaCKClosedForms` is deliberately a `def`, NOT an\n`instance`** (demoted 2026-09-14, bean `qou-hjf4`). Its field values\nare FITTED — the residuals are in the paragraph above — so as a\nparameterless global `instance` it was resolved by instance search\nfor every `[QBetaCKClosedForms]` binder, which made each\n\"conditional\" downstream result unconditional **on a fit**. That is\nthe shape AGENTS.md §\"Axiomatization is NOT a Proof\" rule 2 forbids,\nand it is the same demotion `ClassicalLimitStpart` received on\n2026-08-24. The class is therefore **uninhabited by instance search**,\nwhich is the honest encoding of an open conjecture; `def` keeps the\nvalues citable by name without discharging anything. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:qbeta-c-k-closed-forms","label":"conj:qbeta-c-k-closed-forms","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/conj-qbeta-c-k-closed-forms.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:hoefsmitB","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"hoefsmitB","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/conj-qbeta-c-k-closed-forms.lean#L34-L39","doc":"Hoefsmit off-diagonal coupling on V_(2,1) at H_3(q).\nRe-stated here to keep this conjecture file self-contained;\nthe canonical definition lives in\n`q-beta-categorical-precision-ladder.lean`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}